    "Id": "chassisdef_catapult_iii_CPLT-R4",
    "Name": "Catapult",
    "Details": "With great effort, RISC Engineers upgraded the Catapult II chassis to an Omnimech level of technology. Employing the most advanced equipment at their disposal, this venerable design's weight was reduced to 55 tons without sacrificing any firepower. Unlike the rest of the series, the -R4 does not carry the integrated laser AMS. Instead, every spare ton is devoted to improving its heat sinking capabilities, in service to an extremely heavy energy loadout consisting of two experimental \"hyper lasers,\" with heavy medium lasers in support.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Experimental TC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
